  "critical_safety": [
    "Not a pediatric ThaiPOG protocol.",
    "Do not run unstructured synthetic dosing builder: multiple blocks, timed rescue, age modifiers, IT medications.",
    "Age >65: dose modifications to both MTX block and R-IVAC mesna/ifosfamide/cytarabine; requires specific protocol fields.",
    "HD-MTX requires hydration, urine alkalinization pH≥7, MTX levels at H36/H42/H48 and repeated clearance monitoring.",
    "Review renal function, third space fluid, interactions (co-trimoxazole, NSAIDs, PPIs) and leucovorin rescue; glucarpidase protocol when indicated.",
    "IT administration must comply with dedicated institutional intrathecal policy.",
    "Cycle timing depends on count recovery; cannot assume fixed 21-day interval."
